evidence/

# Sprint prompts are the historical record for a merged PR; per AGENTS.md
# they stay in main untouched after merge. Retroactive prettier updates
# (e.g. a hook version bump that reformats markdown tables) would silently
# re-touch every historical prompt on the next PR, appearing as
# out-of-scope changes to a reviewer.
prompt-*.md
